# Send requests individually with a REST client, or copy them into Postman.
# Start a fresh server for the CRUD sequence. If the created ID differs from
# item_301, replace item_301 in the later requests with data.id from POST.

### Public greeting: 200 HTML
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/greeting

### User A's list: 200, initially 3 items
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu-items
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token

### Filter and paginate: 200, initially Lentil Soup
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu-items?page=1&perPage=10&category=starter
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token

### Read User A's item: 200
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu-items/item_101
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token

### Create: 201, save data.id for the following requests
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu-items
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tomato Soup",
  "category": "starter",
  "sellingPrice": 7,
  "description": "Tomato soup with toasted bread.",
  "isAvailable": true
}

### Read the created item: 200
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu-items/item_301
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token

### Replace editable fields: 200
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu-items/item_301
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tomato Soup",
  "category": "starter",
  "sellingPrice": 8,
  "description": "Tomato soup with toasted bread.",
  "isAvailable": false
}

### Delete the created item: 200 with data: null
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu-items/item_301
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token

### Deleted item: 404
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu-items/item_301
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token

### Missing token: 401
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu-items

### Invalid token: 401
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu-items
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token

### Extra token text: 401
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu-items
Authorization: Bearer admin-token extra

### User A cannot read User B's item: 404
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu-items/item_201
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token

### User B cannot read User A's item: 404
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu-items/item_101
Authorization: Bearer user-b-token

### Administrator can read User B's item: 200
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu-items/item_201
Authorization: Bearer admin-token

### Non-existent seed ID: 404
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu-items/item_999
Authorization: Bearer admin-token

### Invalid fields: 400 with details for name, price, and availability
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu-items
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ab",
  "category": "starter",
  "sellingPrice": -1,
  "isAvailable": "false"
}

### Duplicate of a seeded name: 409
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu-items
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": " LENTIL  SOUP ",
  "category": "starter",
  "sellingPrice": 7
}

### Unsupported method: 405 with Allow header
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu-items/item_101
Authorization: Bearer admin-token

### Invalid pagination: 400
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu-items?perPage=51
Authorization: Bearer user-a-token

### Allowed methods: 204 with Allow header
OPTIONS http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu-items
Authorization: Bearer admin-token
